  "description": "Host-side adapter that makes a device able to SERVE mesh offload turns:\n      it implements CircleAI.Mesh's ILocalInferenceFallback over the raw\n      CircleAI.Hosting.InferenceBridge IInferenceBridge, so a peer's borrowed\n      turn is completed as a clean prompt-to-text call with NONE of this node's\n      own memory, persona, or device context injected (that enrichment belongs to\n      IAIService, and is exactly what a served peer turn must not carry). Call\n      AddBrainInferenceFallback() after AddCircleAiMeshOffload to replace the\n      borrow-only NullLocalInferenceFallback.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
